      size a₀ b₀ e₀ f₀ G D m β ε Q π hpres L s₀ p kval q s a j weightParent weight z hGood
  exact hf βA βrec κ hβA hζκ hC hP hrec herr hζActiveK hεeq hδeq thetaDeep hpot hdeep etaBal x hx hbal hmargin hterminal eta hrowmargin hloadmargin deltaI hIcut hbquarter hh hδα hδstar hδt hhstar hhs hEndpoint
